<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC plans capital repayment.</title>
<headline>SBC plans capital repayment.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp (SBC) said that to mark its 125th anniversary its board plans to propose a capital repayment of 10 Swiss francs in nominal capital per registered share instead of a dividend.</p>
<p>Last year SBC paid a 16 franc per share dividend on its bearer shares and an eight franc per share registered share dividend on its 1995 results.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
